  Output: # Tech Specs — 轻动 (QingDong) MVP V1
  ## Architecture Overview
  - **Two-container deployment**: Backend (FastAPI + SQLite) on port 8000, Frontend (Nginx + static HTML/JS) on port
  80
  - **Database**: SQLite (single file, no external DB server needed)
  - **Authentication**: Session tokens (random 64-byte hex strings), stored in `sessions` table
  - **Password Hashing**: bcrypt via `passlib[bcrypt]`
  - **API Style**: RESTful JSON endpoints under `/api/` prefix
  ## Container Definitions
  ### Backend Container
  - **Base Image**: python:3.11-slim
  - **Port**: 8000
  - **Healthcheck**: `curl --fail http://localhost:8000/health || exit 1`
  - **Startup**: `uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`
  ### Frontend Container
  - **Base Image**: nginx:alpine
  - **Port**: 80
  - **Depends On**: Backend (with `condition: service_healthy`)
  - **Config**: Custom nginx.conf proxying `/api/` to backend, serving static files otherwise
  ## Database Schema
  ### users
  | Column | Type | Constraints |
  |--------|------|-------------|
  | id | INTEGER | PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT |
  | nickname | TEXT | NOT NULL |
  | email | TEXT | UNIQUE, NOT NULL |
  | password_hash | TEXT | NOT NULL |
  | bio | TEXT | DEFAULT '' |
  | created_at | TEXT | DEFAULT (datetime('now')) |
  ### posts
  | Column | Type | Constraints |
  |--------|------|-------------|
  | id | INTEGER | PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT |
  | user_id | INTEGER | NOT NULL, REFERENCES users(id) |
  | content | TEXT | NOT NULL, CHECK(length(content) <= 500) |
  | created_at | TEXT | DEFAULT (datetime('now')) |
  ### follows
  | Column | Type | Constraints |
  |--------|------|-------------|
  | follower_id | INTEGER | NOT NULL, REFERENCES users(id) |
  | followee_id | INTEGER | NOT NULL, REFERENCES users(id) |
  | created_at | TEXT | DEFAULT (datetime('now')) |
  | PRIMARY KEY | (follower_id, followee_id) | |
  ### sessions
  | Column | Type | Constraints |
  |--------|------|-------------|
  | token | TEXT | PRIMARY KEY |
  | user_id | INTEGER | NOT NULL, REFERENCES users(id) |
  | created_at | TEXT | DEFAULT (datetime('now')) |
  ## API Endpoints
  ### Health
  - `GET /health` → `{"status": "ok"}`
  ### Auth
  - `POST /api/auth/register` → Body: `{nickname, email, password}` → `{token, user}`
  - `POST /api/auth/login` → Body: `{email, password}` → `{token, user}`
  - `POST /api/auth/logout` → Header: `Authorization: Token <token>` → `{}`
  ### Posts
  - `POST /api/posts` → Header: Auth, Body: `{content}` → `{post}` (max 500 chars)
  - `GET /api/posts/feed` → Header: Auth, Query: `?cursor=&limit=20` → `{posts, next_cursor}`
  - `GET /api/posts/{id}` → `{post, author}`
  - `DELETE /api/posts/{id}` → Header: Auth → `{}` (owner only)
  ### Users
  - `GET /api/users/{id}` → `{user, posts, post_count, follower_count, followee_count, is_following}`
  - `POST /api/users/{id}/follow` → Header: Auth → `{}` (idempotent)
  - `DELETE /api/users/{id}/follow` → Header: Auth → `{}` (idempotent)
  - `GET /api/users` → Query: `?q=` → Search users by nickname
  ### Suggested Users (cold start)
  - `GET /api/users/suggested` → Header: Auth → `{users: [...]}` (returns up to 5 hardcoded suggested users)
  ## Banned Keywords (enforced by code review)
  No code shall contain: UploadFile, MultipartFile, FileStorage, OSS, S3, CDN, ImageUpload, VideoUpload, /upload,
  /media, image_url, video_url, thumbnail, transcode, MediaHandler, RecommendEngine, RecommendationSystem,
  CollaborativeFiltering, UserInterestProfile, MLModel, user_interests, recommendation_scores, recommend,
  /recommend, PersonalizedFeed, PrivateMessage, DirectMessage, OneOnOneChat, GroupChat, WebSocket, MessageHub,
  /messages, /chat, /ws, messages, conversations, chat_rooms, FriendRequest, FriendshipApproval, FriendApprove,
  FriendReject, /friend_requests, /friends/approve, friend_requests, friendships
